{"path":"ranges/subrange/next","title":"std::ranges::subrange<I,S,K>::next","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::ranges::subrange&lt;I,S,K&gt;::</span>next","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/ranges/subrange/next","section":"ranges","kind":"page","summary":"Returns a subrange whose begin_ is incremented (or decremented if n is negative). The actual increment (or decrement) operation is performed by advance().","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> subrange next<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/iter_t\"><span class=\"kw2893\">std::<span class=\"me2\">iter_difference_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>I<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> n <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span> <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; requires <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/forward_iterator\"><span class=\"kw2884\">std::<span class=\"me2\">forward_iterator</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>I<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\">\n<td><div><span id=\"Version_2\"></span><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> subrange next<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/iter_t\"><span class=\"kw2893\">std::<span class=\"me2\">iter_difference_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span>I<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> n <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span> <span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2)</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns a <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/subrange\"><code>subrange</code></a> whose <code><i><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/subrange#begin\">begin_</a></i></code> is incremented (or decremented if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">n</span></code> is negative). The actual increment (or decrement) operation is performed by <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/subrange/advance\"><code>advance()</code></a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Returns a copy of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\"></span> Equivalent to: <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> tmp <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span><br><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">tmp.<span class=\"me1\">advance</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>n<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span><br><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">return</span> tmp<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Returns a <code>subrange</code> moved from <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\"></span> Equivalent to: <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">advance<span class=\"br0\">(</span>n<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span><br><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">return</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">move</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code>.</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameter\">Parameter</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> n\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> number of maximal increments of the iterator\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>As described above.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>The difference between this function and <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/subrange/advance\"><code>advance()</code></a> is that the latter performs the increment (or decrement) in place.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;array&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iterator&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;print&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;ranges&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/container/array\"><span class=\"kw1276\">std::<span class=\"me2\">array</span></span></a> arr<span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"nu0\">1</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">3</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">4</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">5</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">6</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">7</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/subrange\"><span class=\"kw2928\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">subrange</span></span></a> sub<span class=\"br0\">{</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/next\"><span class=\"kw679\">std::<span class=\"me2\">next</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>arr.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/prev\"><span class=\"kw680\">std::<span class=\"me2\">prev</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span>arr.<span class=\"me1\">end</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>, <span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/println\"><span class=\"kw3402\">std::<span class=\"me2\">println</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"1) sub: {}\"</span>, sub<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/println\"><span class=\"kw3402\">std::<span class=\"me2\">println</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"2) sub: {}\"</span>, sub.<span class=\"me1\">next</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/println\"><span class=\"kw3402\">std::<span class=\"me2\">println</span></span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"3) sub: {}\"</span>, sub.<span class=\"me1\">next</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"nu0\">2</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>1) sub: [3, 4, 5]\n2) sub: [4, 5]\n3) sub: [5]</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/subrange/prev\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>prev</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  obtains a copy of the <code>subrange</code> with its iterator decremented by a given distance <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/subrange/advance\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>advance</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  advances the iterator by given distance <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/next\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>next</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  increment an iterator <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator/ranges/next\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>ranges::next</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td> increment an iterator by a given distance or to a bound<br><span class=\"t-mark\">(algorithm function object)</span></td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameter","id":"Parameter"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"ranges","title":"Ranges library (since C++20)"},{"path":"ranges/subrange","title":"std::ranges::subrange"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::ranges::subrange<I,S,K>::next","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++20. Returns a subrange whose begin_ is incremented (or decremented if n is negative)."},{"label":"Parameter","note":"n"},{"label":"Return value","note":"As described above."},{"label":"Notes","note":"The difference between this function and advance() is that the latter performs the increment (or decrement) in place."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"prev","note":"obtains a copy of the subrange with its iterator decremented by a given distance"},{"label":"advance","note":"advances the iterator by given distance"},{"label":"next","note":"increment an iterator"},{"label":"ranges::next","note":"increment an iterator by a given distance or to a bound"}]}]},"standards":["C++11","C++20"],"wordCount":208,"codeBlock